{"type":"message","id":"0fe5df55","parentId":"61a40ada","timestamp":"2026-03-29T08:36:36.091Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[media attached: /Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/b7778529-88ac-46e4-bece-e47cf1e631ca.jpg (image/jpeg) | /Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/b7778529-88ac-46e4-bece-e47cf1e631ca.jpg]\nTo send an image back, prefer the message tool (media/path/filePath). If you must inline, use MEDIA:https://example.com/image.jpg (spaces ok, quote if needed) or a safe relative path like MEDIA:./image.jpg. Avoid absolute paths (MEDIA:/...) and ~ paths — they are blocked for security. Keep caption in the text body.\nSystem: [2026-03-29 16:36:35 GMT+8] Feishu[default] DM | 用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83) [msg:om_x100b53ba07d174a4c3b625be3c63731, post, 1 attachment(s)]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53ba07d174a4c3b625be3c63731\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户612847\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sun 2026-03-29 16:36 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"name\": \"用户612847\"\n}\n```\n\n/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/b7778529-88ac-46e4-bece-e47cf1e631ca.jpg\n这个是30题的配图"}],"timestamp":1774773396086}}
{"type":"message","id":"5123a69b","parentId":"0fe5df55","timestamp":"2026-03-29T08:36:40.327Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is sending the image for question 30 (digestive system diagram). They want me to combine it with the question text just like I did for question 29. Let me first look at the image, then combine it with the question text.","thinkingSignature":"4519991a2f684e8305f5a53ed4c3ced3684aa214fbe46ec98cfde7dc3a417fe3"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_41lrnxvmuo96_1","name":"image","arguments":{"prompt":"请详细描述这张图片的内容，这是生物消化系统结构图吗？图上有哪些标注和结构？","image":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/b7778529-88ac-46e4-bece-e47cf1e631ca.jpg"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":127,"output":137,"cacheRead":80172,"cacheWrite":403,"totalTokens":80839,"cost":{"input":0.0000381,"output":0.00016439999999999998,"cacheRead":0.00481032,"cacheWrite":0.000151125,"total":0.005163945}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774773396099,"responseId":"0618179440729f8de92f41b625f06764"}}
{"type":"message","id":"5fc863ff","parentId":"5123a69b","timestamp":"2026-03-29T08:36:47.833Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_41lrnxvmuo96_1","toolName":"image","content":[{"type":"text","text":"图中展示的是人体消化系统的解剖结构示意图。通过标注的数字，我们可以识别出以下主要器官和结构：\n\n*   **[1] 食管 (Esophagus)**：连接咽部和胃的管状结构，负责将食物运送到胃部。\n*   **[2] 胃 (Stomach)**：一个囊状器官，通过分泌胃酸和酶来初步消化蛋白质，并将食物搅拌成食糜。\n*   **[3] 肝脏 (Liver)**：人体最大的腺体，负责分泌胆汁（帮助脂肪消化）、解毒以及储存养分。\n*   **[4] 小肠 (Small Intestine)**：图中中间盘曲的部分。它是消化和吸收营养物质的主要场所。\n*   **[5] 大肠 (Large Intestine / Colon)**：围绕在小肠外周的较粗管道。主要功能是吸收水分和残余养分，形成并排出粪便。\n*   **[6] 胰腺 (Pancreas)**：位于胃下方（图中黄色叶片状结构），分泌胰液（含多种消化酶）进入小肠，同时调节血糖。\n*   **[7] 胆囊 (Gallbladder)**：位于肝脏下方的绿色小囊。它的作用是储存浓缩肝脏分泌的胆汁，并在进食时排出。\n\n**总结：**\n这张图清晰地描绘了人体消化道的主要组成部分及其附属腺体（如肝、胰）。食物的消化路线通常是从食管进入胃，经过小肠消化吸收，最后由大肠处理废弃物。其中的肝脏、胆囊和胰腺通过导管向消化道提供必要的消化液。"}],"details":{"model":"minimax/MiniMax-VL-01","image":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/b7778529-88ac-46e4-bece-e47cf1e631ca.jpg","attempts":[]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774773407825}}
{"type":"message","id":"17b2acc9","parentId":"5fc863ff","timestamp":"2026-03-29T08:36:58.693Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, the image shows the digestive system with 7 labeled structures: 食管, 胃, 肝脏, 小肠, 大肠, 胰腺, 胆囊. Now let me combine this with the question 30 text.","thinkingSignature":"3f31757ac0cc4351719ec64f0ba8dd7275bf0136df52388d8974c758c10ba670"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_abscx0fwjoge_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 << 'EOF'\nfrom PIL import Image, ImageDraw, ImageFont\n\nq30_img = Image.open('/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/b7778529-88ac-46e4-bece-e47cf1e631ca.jpg')\nq30_img = q30_img.convert('RGB')\n\nq30_img_w, q30_img_h = q30_img.size\nprint(f'原图尺寸: {q30_img_w} x {q30_img_h}')\n\ntext_img_w = 480\ntotal_w = text_img_w + 40 + q30_img_w\ntotal_h = q30_img_h\n\ncombined = Image.new('RGB', (total_w, total_h), 'white')\ncombined.paste(q30_img, (text_img_w + 40, 0))\n\ndraw = ImageDraw.Draw(combined)\nfont = ImageFont.truetype('/System/Library/Fonts/STHeati Light.ttc', 13)\n\nlines = [\n    '30.（7分）右图是人体消化系统',\n    '结构示意图，据图回答：',\n    '',\n    '（1）人体消化和吸收的主要场所',\n    '是[　]______。',\n    '',\n    '（2）图中[　]______分泌的胆汁',\n    '能促进脂肪的消化。',\n    '',\n    '（3）图中[　]______是消化道中唯',\n    '一没有消化液的结构。',\n    '',\n    '（4）蛋白质在[　]______开始被',\n    '消化，淀粉在[　]______开始被',\n    '消化。',\n    '',\n    '（5）既无消化功能又无吸收功能',\n    '的器官是[　]______。'\n]\n\ny = 20\nfor line in lines:\n    draw.text((15, y), line, fill='black', font=font)\n    y += 22\n\noutput_path = '/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/tool-image-generation/q30_combined_real.png'\ncombined.save(output_path)\nprint(f'保存成功: {output_path}')\nEOF"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":50199,"output":507,"cacheRead":30966,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":81672,"cost":{"input":0.015059699999999999,"output":0.0006083999999999999,"cacheRead":0.0018579599999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.017526059999999996}},"stop