{"type":"message","id":"4947b2d3","parentId":"1319e7c8","timestamp":"2026-03-29T08:56:50.161Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[media attached: /Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/5a8f8786-bf74-4ad8-9f78-10a823fcd8bf.jpg (image/jpeg) | /Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/5a8f8786-bf74-4ad8-9f78-10a823fcd8bf.jpg]\nTo send an image back, prefer the message tool (media/path/filePath). If you must inline, use MEDIA:https://example.com/image.jpg (spaces ok, quote if needed) or a safe relative path like MEDIA:./image.jpg. Avoid absolute paths (MEDIA:/...) and ~ paths — they are blocked for security. Keep caption in the text body.\nSystem: [2026-03-29 16:56:49 GMT+8] Feishu[default] DM | 用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83) [msg:om_x100b53bada31e8acc3197f5a6ffaee1, post, 1 attachment(s)]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53bada31e8acc3197f5a6ffaee1\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户612847\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sun 2026-03-29 16:56 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"name\": \"用户612847\"\n}\n```\n\n/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/5a8f8786-bf74-4ad8-9f78-10a823fcd8bf.jpg\n26题配图"}],"timestamp":1774774610157}}
{"type":"message","id":"5fb38e8e","parentId":"4947b2d3","timestamp":"2026-03-29T08:56:55.460Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is the image for Question 26 - plant cell structure diagram for fill-in-the-blank question. Let me analyze it and then create the combined image with the question text.","thinkingSignature":"b91dbb15cbcd6c3a30e2430debb12495fac6aa748ad690d540dfe91ad2e52935"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_a0g29qsznjax_1","name":"image","arguments":{"prompt":"请详细描述这张图片的内容","image":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/5a8f8786-bf74-4ad8-9f78-10a823fcd8bf.jpg"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":127,"output":113,"cacheRead":87099,"cacheWrite":2279,"totalTokens":89618,"cost":{"input":0.0000381,"output":0.0001356,"cacheRead":0.005225939999999999,"cacheWrite":0.000854625,"total":0.006254264999999999}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774774610167,"responseId":"06181c52cbfa98936e1d2e5f64f193bc"}}
{"type":"message","id":"802537d6","parentId":"5fb38e8e","timestamp":"2026-03-29T08:57:05.074Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_a0g29qsznjax_1","toolName":"image","content":[{"type":"text","text":"这是一张关于**植物细胞结构**的科学示意图。图片中央是一个大的矩形框，代表细胞的轮廓。图中使用了五个带箭头的圆圈编号（①至⑤）来标注不同的细胞结构。\n\n以下是图中各部分的详细说明：\n\n*   **标题**：图片上方印有黑色大字“**植物细胞结构示意图**”。\n*   **① 细胞壁与细胞膜**：箭头指向细胞最外层的厚壁。在植物细胞中，这是**细胞壁**，起到支持和保护作用。紧贴细胞壁内侧的一层薄膜是**细胞膜**，控制物质进出。\n*   **② 叶绿体**：箭头指向散布在细胞质中的椭圆形小器官。内部有横线表示基粒，这是**叶绿体**，是植物进行光合作用的场所。\n*   **③ 细胞核**：箭头指向一个较大的、圆形的深色结构。这是**细胞核**，含有遗传物质，是细胞的控制中心。图中可以看到核内有一个更深色的小圆点（核仁）和一些丝状物（染色质）。\n*   **④ 液泡**：箭头指向细胞中央占据大部分空间的大型透明区域。这是植物细胞特有的**大液泡**，内含细胞液，储存水分、营养物质和废物。\n*   **⑤ 细胞质**：箭头指向填充在细胞膜以内、液泡以外的透明胶状物质。这是**细胞质**，是进行生命活动的主要场所，各种细胞器都悬浮在其中。\n\n**画面风格**：\n整张图片采用简洁的黑白线条图形式，背景为纯白色。各部分结构清晰，比例协调，旨在直观地展示植物细胞的基本组成。它典型地反映了成熟植物细胞的特征，如拥有大型中央液泡、众多的叶绿体以及坚固的细胞壁。"}],"details":{"model":"minimax/MiniMax-VL-01","image":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/5a8f8786-bf74-4ad8-9f78-10a823fcd8bf.jpg","attempts":[]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774774625067}}
{"type":"message","id":"1b4c0f98","parentId":"802537d6","timestamp":"2026-03-29T08:57:16.841Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is the plant cell diagram for Q26 - it has 5 numbered labels (① to ⑤), which is slightly different from Q2 (which has 4 labels). The Q26 diagram has:\n- ① 细胞壁与细胞膜\n- ② 叶绿体\n- ③ 细胞核\n- ④ 液泡\n- ⑤ 细胞质This matches the Q26 fill-in-the-blank question. Now let me create the combined image with the question text.","thinkingSignature":"e09e3dd20012f6ff3f7296d6c173650d3e2c4fb5a7b8a2cd06f950a01d65131d"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_n3278kgxwbnr_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 << 'EOF'\nfrom PIL import Image, ImageDraw, ImageFont\nimport os\n\nq26_img = Image.open('/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/5a8f8786-bf74-4ad8-9f78-10a823fcd8bf.jpg')\nq26_img = q26_img.convert('RGB')\n\nq26_img_w, q26_img_h = q26_img.size\nprint(f'原图尺寸: {q26_img_w} x {q26_img_h}')\n\ntext_img_w = 480\ntotal_w = text_img_w + 40 + q26_img_w\ntotal_h = q26_img_h\n\ncombined = Image.new('RGB', (total_w, total_h), 'white')\ncombined.paste(q26_img, (text_img_w + 40, 0))\n\ndraw = ImageDraw.Draw(combined)\n\nfont = None\nfor fp in ['/System/Library/Fonts/STHeati Light.ttc', '/System/Library/Fonts/PingFang.ttc', '/Library/Fonts/Arial Unicode.ttf']:\n    if os.path.exists(fp):\n        try:\n            font = ImageFont.truetype(fp, 13)\n            print(f'使用字体: {fp}')\n            break\n        except:\n            continue\n\nif font is None:\n    font = ImageFont.load_default()\n\nlines = [\n    '26.（5分）右图是植物细胞结构示意',\n    '图，据图回答：',\n    '',\n    '（1）图中②是______，它具有支持和',\n    '保护作用。',\n    '',\n    '（2）控制细胞内外物质进出的是图中',\n    '标号______。',\n    '',\n    '（3）叶绿体存在于图中标号______内。',\n    '',\n    '（4）细胞生命活动的控制中心是',\n    '标号______。',\n    '',\n    '（5）储存糖分和色素的结构是',\n    '标号______。'\n]\n\ny = 20\nfor line in lines:\n    draw.text((15, y), line, fill='black', font=font)\n    y += 22\n\noutput_path = '/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/tool-image-generation/q26_combined_real.png'\ncombined.save(output_path)\nprint(f'保存成功')\nEOF"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":59016,"output":606,"cacheRead":30966,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":90588,"cost":{"input":0.0177048,"output":0.0007272,"cacheRead":0.0018579599999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.02028996}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774774625076,"responseId":"06181c613d7d3c3f72cd14ea862c8d89"}}
