{"type":"message","id":"5174300b","parentId":"bc2d76a1","timestamp":"2026-03-29T09:00:55.847Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[media attached: /Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/1de8fe4b-6be9-4000-a2b0-0f25ebfc8366.jpg (image/jpeg) | /Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/1de8fe4b-6be9-4000-a2b0-0f25ebfc8366.jpg]\nTo send an image back, prefer the message tool (media/path/filePath). If you must inline, use MEDIA:https://example.com/image.jpg (spaces ok, quote if needed) or a safe relative path like MEDIA:./image.jpg. Avoid absolute paths (MEDIA:/...) and ~ paths — they are blocked for security. Keep caption in the text body.\nSystem: [2026-03-29 17:00:54 GMT+8] Feishu[default] DM | 用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83) [msg:om_x100b53baea9a24a8c3f34fb0e665e36, post, 1 attachment(s)]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53baea9a24a8c3f34fb0e665e36\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户612847\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sun 2026-03-29 17:00 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"name\": \"用户612847\"\n}\n```\n\n/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/1de8fe4b-6be9-4000-a2b0-0f25ebfc8366.jpg\n27题配图"}],"timestamp":1774774855839}}
{"type":"message","id":"8e4e52f0","parentId":"5174300b","timestamp":"2026-03-29T09:01:01.202Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This looks like a duplicate of the heart image. Let me analyze it anyway to confirm.","thinkingSignature":"2206ef68892c9b33f8187808fdc33e52077e7a650a1f1568abe7fde10b8cb3f5"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_52vo1npo2x8w_1","name":"image","arguments":{"prompt":"请详细描述这张图片的内容，这是心脏结构图吗？图上有那些标注？","image":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/1de8fe4b-6be9-4000-a2b0-0f25ebfc8366.jpg"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":127,"output":106,"cacheRead":90685,"cacheWrite":1188,"totalTokens":92106,"cost":{"input":0.0000381,"output":0.0001272,"cacheRead":0.0054411,"cacheWrite":0.0004455,"total":0.0060519}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774774855858,"responseId":"06181d4811240733656822474c2f0cf8"}}
{"type":"message","id":"842fbe90","parentId":"8e4e52f0","timestamp":"2026-03-29T09:01:15.238Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_52vo1npo2x8w_1","toolName":"image","content":[{"type":"text","text":"这是一张人体心脏结构的剖面示意图，主要用于展示心脏的内部构造以及血液循环的流向。\n\n是的，这是一张非常典型的**心脏结构图**。\n\n以下是图中所有标注及其对应的中文和英文解说：\n\n### **心脏的四个腔室 (Numbered 1-4):**\n1.  **右心房 [1] (Right Atrium):** 接收来自全身的缺氧血。\n2.  **右心室 [2] (Right Ventricle):** 将缺氧血泵入肺动脉送往肺部。\n3.  **左心房 [3] (Left Atrium):** 接收来自肺部的含氧血。\n4.  **左心室 [4] (Left Ventricle):** 心脏最强有力的腔室，将含氧血泵入主动脉送往全身。\n\n### **主要血管 (Blood Vessels):**\n*   **上下腔静脉入口 (Superior and Inferior Vena Cava Inlets):** 位于图片左侧（解剖学上的右侧），指全身血液回流进右心房的通道。\n*   **肺动脉 (Pulmonary Artery):** 从右心室出发，将血液送往肺部的血管。\n*   **肺静脉 (Pulmonary Veins):** 位于图片右侧，将肺部氧合后的血液送回左心房的血管。\n*   **主动脉 (Aorta):** 心脏上方最大的血管，负责将血液输送到全身。\n\n### **内部结构与瓣膜 (Internal Structures and Valves):**\n*   **房室瓣 (Atrioventricular Valves):** 分别位于心房和心室之间。\n    *   右侧（图中左边）是三尖瓣。\n    *   左侧（图中右边）是二尖瓣（僧帽瓣）。\n    *   它们的作用是防止血液倒流。\n*   **室间隔 (Interventricular Septum):** 位于左、右心室之间的厚实肌肉墙，防止左右心室的血液混合。\n\n### **图中的其他细节：**\n*   **黑色箭头:** 表示血液流动的方向。你可以看到血液从静脉进入心房，流向心室，最后通过动脉泵出心脏。\n*   **阴影处理:** 通过深浅不一的灰色表现了心脏肌肉（心肌）的厚度，可以明显看到左心室 [4] 的壁比右心室 [2] 的壁要厚得多，因为左心室需要更大的压力将血液送往全身。"}],"details":{"model":"minimax/MiniMax-VL-01","image":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/1de8fe4b-6be9-4000-a2b0-0f25ebfc8366.jpg","attempts":[]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774774875230}}
{"type":"message","id":"d62c032f","parentId":"842fbe90","timestamp":"2026-03-29T09:01:27.403Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This looks like the same heart image as before. But the user is sending it again as the image for question 27. Let me check - they already sent heart image (a1fdd858) for Q27 earlier. Maybe this is a different version or they want to use this one instead. Let me use this new image to make the combined image.","thinkingSignature":"ebb82e8ea6a0a430dddc941dbf04688a0adfcabdffa46a441a56aee6c56586a6"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_670f3u8pu5d8_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 << 'EOF'\nfrom PIL import Image, ImageDraw, ImageFont\nimport os\n\nq27_img = Image.open('/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/1de8fe4b-6be9-4000-a2b0-0f25ebfc8366.jpg')\nq27_img = q27_img.convert('RGB')\n\nq27_img_w, q27_img_h = q27_img.size\nprint(f'原图尺寸: {q27_img_w} x {q27_img_h}')\n\ntext_img_w = 480\ntotal_w = text_img_w + 40 + q27_img_w\ntotal_h = q27_img_h\n\ncombined = Image.new('RGB', (total_w, total_h), 'white')\ncombined.paste(q27_img, (text_img_w + 40, 0))\n\ndraw = ImageDraw.Draw(combined)\n\nfont = None\nfor fp in ['/System/Library/Fonts/STHeati Light.ttc', '/System/Library/Fonts/PingFang.ttc', '/Library/Fonts/Arial Unicode.ttf']:\n    if os.path.exists(fp):\n        try:\n            font = ImageFont.truetype(fp, 13)\n            print(f'使用字体: {fp}')\n            break\n        except:\n            continue\n\nif font is None:\n    font = ImageFont.load_default()\n\nlines = [\n    '27.（5分）右图是心脏结构示意',\n    '图，据图回答：',\n    '',\n    '（1）心脏的四个腔中壁最厚的是',\n    '[　]______。',\n    '',\n    '（2）血液从心房流向心室时，不',\n    '会倒流回心房，是因为有[　]______。',\n    '',\n    '（3）肺循环的起点是[　]______，',\n    '终点是[　]______。',\n    '',\n    '（4）主动脉内流动的是______血。',\n    '',\n    '（5）左心房与左心室之间的瓣膜',\n    '叫______，右心房与右心室',\n    '之间的瓣膜叫______。'\n]\n\ny = 20\nfor line in lines:\n    draw.text((15, y), line, fill='black', font=font)\n    y += 22\n\noutput_path = '/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/tool-image-generation/q27_combined_real_v2.png'\ncombined.save(output_path)\nprint(f'保存成功')\nEOF"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":61654,"output":616,"cacheRead":30966,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":93236,"cost":{"input":0.0184962,"output":0.0007392,"cacheRead":0.0018579599999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.02109336}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774774875240,"responseId":"06181d5bc3d15680b3e5db2de3f7e858"}}
