{"type":"message","id":"0eb4a9ca","parentId":"7899a790","timestamp":"2026-03-29T09:17:03.179Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"继续发送第21题，需要先合并渗透作用天平实验图的题目。频哥之前发了图21（渗透作用天平实验图），但我还没合并过。让我合并一下再发送。","thinkingSignature":"55c2585358bb9748fbcc3bd4d4046f497d08072de18a6f4f2cf947c2092f7920"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_mdq4fuuu88u2_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 << 'EOF'\nfrom PIL import Image, ImageDraw, ImageFont\nimport os\n\n# 使用频哥之前发的渗透作用天平图\nq21_img_path = '/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/f8a52729-e3ae-4292-ac0e-2a102f86e3ab.jpg'\nq21_img = Image.open(q21_img_path)\nq21_img = q21_img.convert('RGB')\n\nq21_img_w, q21_img_h = q21_img.size\nprint(f'原图尺寸: {q21_img_w} x {q21_img_h}')\n\ntext_img_w = 480\ntotal_w = text_img_w + 40 + q21_img_w\ntotal_h = q21_img_h\n\ncombined = Image.new('RGB', (total_w, total_h), 'white')\ncombined.paste(q21_img, (text_img_w + 40, 0))\n\ndraw = ImageDraw.Draw(combined)\n\nfont = None\nfor fp in ['/System/Library/Fonts/STHeati Light.ttc', '/System/Library/Fonts/PingFang.ttc', '/Library/Fonts/Arial Unicode.ttf']:\n    if os.path.exists(fp):\n        try:\n            font = ImageFont.truetype(fp, 13)\n            print(f'使用字体: {fp}')\n            break\n        except:\n            continue\n\nif font is None:\n    font = ImageFont.load_default()\n\nlines = [\n    '21.（2分）如右图所示，天平两端',\n    '平衡，则下列叙述正确的是（　　）',\n    '',\n    'A. 甲烧杯中为清水，乙烧杯中为盐水',\n    'B. 萝卜细胞通过渗透作用吸水',\n    'C. 该实验说明细胞壁具有支持作用',\n    'D. 两烧杯中的浓度差越大，萝卜条',\n    '　吸水越多'\n]\n\ny = 20\nfor line in lines:\n    draw.text((15, y), line, fill='black', font=font)\n    y += 22\n\noutput_path = '/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/tool-image-generation/q21_combined_real.png'\ncombined.save(output_path)\nprint(f'保存成功')\nEOF"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":64946,"output":529,"cacheRead":30966,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":96441,"cost":{"input":0.0194838,"output":0.000634799